        <Tests>
          <Name>QSEQ_DOTNETTest.QSEQ_DOTNETTests.StopQSEQSession</Name>
          <Parameters>
            <ParameterCls>
              <Name>saveToStorageFolder</Name>
              <RealName>saveToStorageFolder</RealName>
              <NoOfElements>1</NoOfElements>
              <Value>True</Value>
              <DataType>Boolean</DataType>
              <Type>Input</Type>
              <EnableDataLoggingAsString>F</EnableDataLoggingAsString>
              <EnableChartingAsString>F</EnableChartingAsString>
              <UseRunTimeLimits>false</UseRunTimeLimits>
              <Description>Set to 'True' to save the XML result file to the storage drive defined in the Device Config XML.</Description>
              <ArrayParameterRIDsAsString />
            </ParameterCls>
            <ParameterCls>
              <Name>useTestTreeFileName</Name>
              <RealName>useTestTreeFileName</RealName>
              <NoOfElements>1</NoOfElements>
              <Value>True</Value>
              <DataType>Boolean</DataType>
              <Type>Input</Type>
              <EnableDataLoggingAsString>F</EnableDataLoggingAsString>
              <EnableChartingAsString>F</EnableChartingAsString>
              <UseRunTimeLimits>false</UseRunTimeLimits>
              <Description>When 'saveToStorageFolder' is 'True': 
Set this parameter to 'True' to use the XTT file name to create the storage path for the XML result file. 
Set this parameter to 'False' to ignore the XTT filename and save the XML result file directly to the path specified in the Device Config XML within the XMLLogStorageFolderPath tag. 

When 'saveToStorageFolder is 'False', this parameter is ignored.</Description>
              <ArrayParameterRIDsAsString />
            </ParameterCls>
            <ParameterCls>
              <Name>disconnectPhoneServer</Name>
              <RealName>disconnectPhoneServer</RealName>
              <NoOfElements>1</NoOfElements>
              <Value>True</Value>
              <DataType>Boolean</DataType>
              <Type>Input</Type>
              <EnableDataLoggingAsString>F</EnableDataLoggingAsString>
              <EnableChartingAsString>F</EnableChartingAsString>
              <UseRunTimeLimits>false</UseRunTimeLimits>
              <Description>When 'disconnectPhoneServer' is 'True': 
Set this parameter to 'True' to kill the instance of Phone Server started by the QSEQ Session. 
Set this parameter to 'False' to ignore the instance of Phone Server at let it run even after the current QSEQ Session ends.
</Description>
              <ArrayParameterRIDsAsString />
            </ParameterCls>
            <ParameterCls>
              <Name>xmlFilePath</Name>
              <RealName>xmlFilePath</RealName>
              <NoOfElements>1</NoOfElements>
              <Value />
              <DataType>String</DataType>
              <Type>Output</Type>
              <EnableDataLoggingAsString>T</EnableDataLoggingAsString>
              <EnableChartingAsString>F</EnableChartingAsString>
              <UseRunTimeLimits>false</UseRunTimeLimits>
              <Description>Complete path to QSEQ generated xml log.
</Description>
              <ArrayParameterRIDsAsString />
            </ParameterCls>
          </Parameters>
        </Tests>
